  "provenance": "Constructed from ReactOS shell, Control Panel, system tray, and application icons (GPL-2.0-or-later) combined with Fluent UI System Icons vector shapes (Microsoft, MIT licence), recoloured and edited by eye to match the Windows XP Luna visual identity (warm yellow-gold folders, icy silver-blue Recycle Bin with emerald and cyan arrows, amber and red Start menu action buttons, yellow Favorites star, and royal-blue window/help/power badges). All icons verified clean against original reference assets (all RMSE > 0.05).",
